==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la}} [[virgo]], maiden + [[intacta]], untouched, intact.

===Noun===
'''[[virgo]] [[intacta]]'''

# {{medicine}} a girl or woman whose [[hymen]] remains unbroken
# a woman who has never had [[sexual intercourse]]
#: Note: usually used as an adjective - "She was still virgo intacta."

====Synonyms====
* (''woman who has never had sexual intercourse''): [[maiden]], [[virgin]]